{"id": "core-dpmpp-2s-ancestral", "name": "DPM++ 2S Ancestral (VE path)", "family": "sampler", "subfamily": "ancestral", "plain": "A two-stage single-step DPM++ method on x0 with ancestral noise. It evaluates at the midpoint in log \u03c3 toward \u03c3_down and uses that second prediction for the full step. Non-flow branch; flow models use the RF entry.", "math": "Symbols: x current latent; \u03c3=sigmas[i]; \u03c3'=sigmas[i+1]; D=denoised (x0 prediction after CFG); U=uncond_denoised; d=(x\u2212D)/\u03c3. \nget_ancestral_step: \u03c3_up=min(\u03c3', \u03b7\u00b7\u221a(\u03c3'\u00b2(\u03c3\u00b2\u2212\u03c3'\u00b2)/\u03c3\u00b2)); \u03c3_down=\u221a(\u03c3'\u00b2\u2212\u03c3_up\u00b2); \u03b7=0 returns (\u03c3', 0).\nt=\u2212log \u03c3, t_d=\u2212log \u03c3_down, h=t_d\u2212t, s=t+h/2.\nx\u2082=(\u03c3(s)/\u03c3)x\u2212(e^{\u2212h/2}\u22121)D; D\u2082 at \u03c3(s); x'=(\u03c3_down/\u03c3)x\u2212(e^{\u2212h}\u22121)D\u2082. If \u03c3'>0: x'+=n\u00b7s_noise\u00b7\u03c3_up.", "props": {"order": 2, "stages": "2; 1 when \u03c3_down=0", "stochastic": "ancestral", "multistep": false, "prediction_space": "x0 in \u2212log \u03c3", "final_sigma0": "Explicit: \u03c3_down=0 Euler branch, equals D, no noise.", "flow_const": "Dispatches to sample_dpmpp_2s_ancestral_RF on CONST."}, "evidence": [{"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:716", "symbol": "sample_dpmpp_2s_ancestral"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:717", "symbol": "CONST"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:744", "symbol": "x_2"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:746", "symbol": "denoised_2"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:749", "symbol": "noise_sampler"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy_extras/nodes_custom_sampler.py:489", "symbol": "dpmpp_2s_ancestral"}], "providers": [{"pack": "core", "author": "Comfy Org and contributors", "licence": "GPL-3.0", "kind": "original", "nodes": ["KSampler", "KSamplerAdvanced", "KSamplerSelect", "SamplerDPMPP_2S_Ancestra